otocol）宣布关闭自有区块链并迁往 Sui，获得 Sui Foundation 3000 万美元投资，Sui Foundation 将成为 DATA Network 最大机构持有者。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/21/how-a16z-backed-data-is-rethinking-its-blockchain-strategy-after-usd30-million-sui-deal","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T15:22:46.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":4,"citationId":"z3ff3n4df49re5suj7qmavpnf"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"OpenAI将把AI模型引入Google云，进一步拓展Microsoft之外的渠道","summary":"OpenAI宣布将在未来数周内把GPT产品接入Google云的model garden和Antigravity编程工具，通过Google Cloud向开发者提供其模型，这是继Microsoft结束独家授权、Amazon宣布托管之后的又一扩张，使其模型覆盖三大顶级云基础设施提供商。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/21/openai-bring-its-ai-models-to-googles-cloud-expands-beyond-microsoft.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T12:00:02.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"by8a0xdbtv7t7ahjdg63r1xaf"}]},{"label":"观点与教程","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Bybit CEO 称将寻求券商合作进入美国市场，并考虑英国扩张","summary":"Bybit CEO Ben Zhou 表示，进入美国市场时公司将寻找已有美国客户基础的本地企业合作，例如 Interactive Brokers，以挑战 Robinhood 等公司的覆盖范围。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/16/bybit-will-look-for-big-broker-partnerships-to-take-on-robinhood-in-the-u-s","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T15:09:22.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"xks9odx62v2qei78nzbjkq2qb"}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"华尔街以内部拍卖和鼓励加空仓腾挪资产负债表，美股总杠杆率升至214%","summary":"据彭博报道，巴克莱在触及对冲基金客户融资上限后，通过内部拍卖将宏观利率交易台的资本配额借调给大宗经纪业务，以维持对亚洲客户的贷款扩张；高盛等银行则鼓励对冲基金客户加仓空头，压缩账面资产负债表占用。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784162","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T00:20:09.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"vs5xfk69chv6vfov95c9oya3k"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"英伟达洽谈向澳大利亚AI云服务商Firmus投资数亿美元","summary":"据The Information援引知情人士消息，英伟达(NVDA.O)正与澳大利亚AI云服务提供商Firmus洽谈投资，金额可能达数亿美元，而Firmus本月初曾突然撤回IPO计划。该媒体分析称，英伟达已为Neocloud等大型客户投入超过1700亿美元的资金承诺，还包括为客户提供信用担保以帮助其获得债务融资。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15bc7-cd5f-74d5-9824-b0464b75e076","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T00:06:23.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"exklc89k9dbbgo5ka2bg2bqtp"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Securitize接入Anchorage Digital Bank稳定币，打通代币化交易美元端","summary":"Securitize宣布接入Anchorage Digital Bank发行的稳定币，支持机构客户在其平台进行代币化交易，由Anchorage Digital Bank负责稳定币的铸造与赎回，并提供托管和结算服务，使交易美元端与证券端适用相应的交易对手方及托管标准。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15e88-a018-7496-9092-5406ea44b76a","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T12:56:14.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":4,"citationId":"c9dzf00bpmb6im96utw8dsqfu"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"AI算力叙事分裂：马斯克称供不应求，Citadel创始人警告价格自由落体","summary":"华尔街见闻梳理了AI算力投资的叙事分歧：马斯克称算力严重短缺、回本周期或压缩至六个月，2027年拟新增10GW；谷歌CEO皮查伊确认客户锁定2027年算力极其困难，需求预测已系统性失效；Citadel创始人Ken Griffin则警告GPU边际成本极低，供过于求将致现货价格自由落体，折旧模型失效与企业ROI收紧风险浮现，市场重新定价才刚开始。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784102","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T06:07:18.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"kvvsiywom96nq7utbzecwt5mv"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国财长贝森特称GENIUS法案为支付稳定币建立联邦监管框架","summary":"美国财政部长贝森特表示，GENIUS法案是美国金融领域的里程碑，为数字时代的支付稳定币建立了联邦监管框架，并将其与1863年《国家银行货币法》为银行发行货币建立国家级框架相提并论。他还表示，美国货币监理署（OCC）发布的最终规则将进一步落实该法案，为私营部门创新、市场竞争及美国在数字资产领域保持领先地位提供清晰且可行的制度基础。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15efd-d265-73e0-bac5-0b038e19cb60","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T15:04:15.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"zoxifkz48e0jt83tcj61cwlba"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"灰度扩大加密产品实物申购，覆盖BTC、ETH、SOL等10只产品","summary":"灰度宣布扩大实物申购服务，符合条件的投资者可直接交付数字资产换取旗下产品份额，无需先卖出换法币再现金申购。该机制已覆盖10只产品，包括比特币迷你信托ETF（BTC）、以太坊质押迷你ETF（ETH）、Solana质押ETF（GSOL）、XRP信托ETF（GXRP）等。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15e99-1fe9-7223-8cf2-a47942c8865c","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T13:14:15.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"ervq23i1d1686leqqcqpxyl8s"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Western Union 携手 Noah 推出 USDPT 稳定币汇款服务","summary":"Western Union 选择稳定币支付基础设施提供商 Noah，为其 Receiver Redirect 服务提供链上银行网络，收款方可按 USDPT 稳定币收取资金，覆盖超过 60 种货币和 200 多个国家和地区，目标是把跨境转账时间从数天缩短至数小时并降低手续费。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2297920","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T12:23:17.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"j1ulnxdbiuysfqvrsh7qth4al"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"伯克希尔B类股突破巴菲特卸任前历史高点，市场为阿贝尔时代重新定价","summary":"伯克希尔B类股周三刷新历史高位，突破2025年5月2日创下的前高，截至发稿上涨0.5%至542.6美元，市场信心从巴菲特离任的担忧转向对继任者格雷格·阿贝尔的背书。阿贝尔接任不到一年，已调整管理层、恢复股票回购，并敲定收购泰勒·莫里森家居公司相关资产、投资Alphabet两笔数十亿美元交易。伯克希尔预计于11月7日公布第三季度财报。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784142","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T15:48:55.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"u52s98e3bsi7ro18aco2489tp"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"中金：增配黄金可对冲AI资产风险","summary":"中金公司李昭等认为，除现金、中债和高股息股票外，美元贬值交易同样可对冲AI风险，增配黄金是执行该交易的有效工具，2026年黄金与美元相关系数达-81.2%。复盘2000年以来91段美元下跌区间，黄金上涨84次，胜率92.3%，区间收益率中位数5.46%，优于2年期和10年期美债的68.1%和64.8%。报告提示该对冲逻辑的主要风险是美元流动性危机，并建议在增配高股息、现金与中债之外增加黄金配置。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784163","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T00:17:23.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"o7g3ij7yjfcsivuub1fafhxo7"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"英国高等法院批准钱志敏案中国受害者就法律适用裁决上诉","summary":"英国高等法院批准约1.6万名参与英国追索的中国受害者，就10月12日关于钱志敏案逾6万枚比特币财产权争议适用中国法的裁决提出上诉，该裁决作出仅四天。各方律师还讨论了法律适用争议的诉讼费用、约1.6万名个人申请人是否继续追索及如何退出等问题。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a15db1-d5db-7301-ab01-699a99cceb89","publishedAt":"2026-10-21T09:01:38.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"o6cpo3alpse91m6clbcwxx2dj"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":10,"sourcesCount":5,"firstPartyEvents":10},"readingMinutes":4,"prev":"2026-10-22","next":"2026-10-24"}